cabal-version: 3.8
name: aihc
version: 0.1.0.0
build-type: Custom
license: Unlicense
license-file: LICENSE
author: David Himmelstrup
maintainer: lemmih@gmail.com
category: Development
synopsis: The AIHC compiler and its command-line tools
description: The AIHC package contains the compiler and its production and development command-line tools.
